# Goal

Automatically generate a permanent, signed PDF document when an HOD approves an application. This signed document will be stored on the server and made available to both the Computer Centre (CC) Admin for processing and the HOD for their records.

## Open Questions

> [!WARNING]
> Please review these questions before proceeding:
> 1. The backend will need to generate the PDF using a library like `puppeteer`. Is it acceptable if the PDF generation causes a slight delay (1-2 seconds) during the HOD's "Approve" action?
> 2. Currently, the CC Admin dashboard only shows a list of applications. Should I add a "Download Signed Document" button directly in the CC Admin's application review modal, similar to what we added for the HOD?

