## Verification Plan

### Manual Verification
1. Log in as an HOD and approve a pending application.
2. Verify that the backend successfully generates a PDF file in the `uploads/pdfs` directory.
3. Log in as a CC Admin and open the newly approved application. Verify the "Download Signed Document" button works and fetches the correct file.
4. Log back in as the HOD, go to "Reviewed Applications", and verify that downloading the document retrieves the exact same server-generated signed PDF.
